            B.q("sa-m4-6", "sa-identity", "The company wants to move from AD FS to password hash synchronization, but test it with a pilot group first, without switching every user at once. What do you recommend?", listOf("Staged rollout of cloud authentication for a pilot group", "Turn off AD FS on a weekend and hope", "Create new cloud-only accounts for the pilot", "Federate a second domain"), setOf(0), "Staged rollout lets chosen groups sign in with cloud authentication, such as password hash synchronization, while everyone else stays on federation. You test with a pilot and widen it before switching the whole domain.",
