            B.q("sa-m4-7", "sa-identity", "One Function app needs its own identity to reach a queue, and that identity should be removed automatically when the app is deleted. What do you recommend?", listOf("A user-assigned managed identity", "A system-assigned managed identity", "A service principal with a certificate", "The developer's own account"), setOf(1), "A system-assigned managed identity is created with the resource and deleted with it. For a single app whose access should end with the app, it is the simplest choice, with nothing left behind.",
                scenario = "Brightstone's Android coupon app uses a Function app that reads from one storage queue. The security team found orphaned identities from deleted apps and wants that to stop.",
