            B.q("sa-m4-15", "sa-governance", "Twenty related policies, such as encryption, diagnostic and network rules, must be assigned together to many management groups, with shared parameters and one compliance score. What do you recommend?", listOf("Assign each of the 20 policies separately at the root management group", "Group them in a policy initiative and assign the initiative", "Deploy the 20 policy assignments to each management group from one template spec", "Package the policies in an Azure Blueprints definition and assign the blueprint"), setOf(1), "An initiative, or policy set definition, groups policies so they are assigned, parameterised and reported as one unit. Changes to the initiative reach every assignment.",
                scenario = "Northcliffe Insurance has a security baseline of 20 policies for every workload, including its Android claims app. Assigning them one by one has led to gaps.",
