            B.q("sa-m4-20", "sa-relational", "A PostgreSQL database for development is used lightly and unevenly, and cost must be minimal. Which compute tier of Azure Database for PostgreSQL flexible server fits?", listOf("Memory Optimized", "General Purpose", "Burstable", "Business Critical"), setOf(2), "The Burstable tier uses low-cost VMs that build up credits when idle and burst when busy. It suits development and light workloads that do not need full CPU all the time.",
