            B.q("sa-m4-23", "sa-nonrelational", "User profile containers for a virtual desktop pool need fast, consistent file storage over SMB. Which storage do you recommend?", listOf("Azure Files premium (SSD) shares", "Standard Azure Files on hard disks", "Blob Storage archive tier", "Azure Table storage"), setOf(0), "Profile containers are read and written heavily at sign-in. Premium Azure Files runs on SSDs with low latency and high IOPS (input/output operations per second), which gives users quick sign-ins.",
