            // Data integration
            B.q("sa-m4-27", "sa-data-integration", "The self-hosted integration runtime that reaches on-premises databases is a single point of failure, and it is overloaded at night. What do you recommend?", listOf("Add a second node to the same self-hosted integration runtime", "Switch to the Azure integration runtime without a managed virtual network, reaching the databases over the site-to-site VPN", "Move the runtime onto the SQL Server machine to cut out a network hop", "Give the runtime's machine more CPU and raise its concurrent jobs limit"), setOf(0), "A self-hosted integration runtime can have up to four nodes. Extra nodes give high availability, so jobs keep running if one machine fails, and share the load.",
